    {
      "id": "claim_c31be78553df48c8ace45cd4fef0826d",
      "statement": "DesignDB sheets (ElementTypes, PositionTypes, optional Positions) are parsed and collections (rows whose Ref appears as another's ParentRef) are filtered out at parse time but tracked separately in collection_refs. All IsDeleted='Y' rows are stripped. Multiple DesignDBs are merged by ref (case-insensitive; first wins) to support multi-building projects sharing one PS and RS.",
