    {
      "id": "claim_cfc718000c81405789c83d17fd076811",
      "statement": "Product Spec rows carry identity EntityRef (the ElementType being specified), plus app-owned fields: Manufacturer, ProductCode, ComponentDescription, InternalNotesText, IsTBC, IsPropertiesTBC, IsDeleted (all field-level patchable). Upstream-owned columns (CutPoint, ExternalNotesText, etc.) are never written; must survive export. Every row gets a _id (UUID) and _row_num (Excel absolute row, null until first export).",
