      "id": "claim_21ae3465fd23400ea5c734e54a44fbc0",
      "statement": "Recipes Spec rows carry a two-level identity (ContextType + ContextRef + RecipeIndex + EntityRef), grouping by section (PositionType-level or ElementType-level/internal). A row carries either Quantity (count-based) or Dim_QuantityMultiplier (dimensioned, for tapes/profiles/diffusers), never both; qtyPair() infers which based on ET ref keywords and defaults.",
