    {
      "id": "claim_ebbe09d1d1d544669ad9c74549513cda",
      "statement": "Recipe rows carry every RS export field under two names: PascalCase (from Excel) and camelCase (app convention), both kept in sync. normalizeRsUpdates() automatically mirrors writes to both versions, preventing export-detection gaps where a camelCase-only patch leaves stale PascalCase in front of it.",
