    {
      "id": "claim_66e0340c03ad462294d2eacc6bd8af77",
      "statement": "Every row (PS, RS, ElementType, PositionType) carries _id (UUID, React key and change tracker) and _row_num (1-based Excel row, null until first export). After export, backend assigns _row_num; the app stamps it onto the in-memory row so subsequent edits generate patches, not duplicate appends. Natural keys (EntityRef for PS; ContextType/ContextRef/RecipeIndex/EntityRef for RS) provide belt-and-braces deduplication after crash recovery.",
