    {
      "id": "claim_54736e03e94c47e8be5e17efe0678942",
      "statement": "Recipes Spec ElementType-level rows are duplicated at parse time once per PositionType claiming that ET as IsDesign='Y'. All copies share _row_num (so bulk edits to that ET propagate to all positions) but have different PositionTypeRef (one per position). Orphan ET rows (no position claims them) are dropped.",
      "evidence": [
